{"subject_id": "9064386", "chunk_id": "eee32a139a98", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "无标题", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 0, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T10:26:54", "source_id": "detail_9064386_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "无标题", "text": "HALO概念介绍\n2月24日，高盛表示，在人工智能颠覆市场、实际收益率走高以及地缘政治格局分化的时代，投资者正追捧具备“HALO效应”（重资产、低淘汰率）特征的股票。", "uid": "f99d8e58c59f", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9064386", "chunk_id": "12f860fdc7f6", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心定义与本质", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 1, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T10:26:54", "source_id": "detail_9064386_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "核心定义与本质", "text": "HALO = Heavy Assets（重资产） + Low Obsolescence（低淘汰）\nHeavy Assets：需巨额资本、长周期建设、高准入壁垒，难以快速复制（如电网、管道、铁路、数据中心、原材料产能）。\nLow Obsolescence：技术迭代难以颠覆，需求刚性、生命周期极长（几十年甚至上百年），越发展越依赖。\n本质：AI 时代对不可复制的实体稀缺性重新定价，对冲轻资产被 AI 颠覆的风险。", "uid": "8fc79623d97d", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9064386", "chunk_id": "e2f353c49dbe", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "兴起背景（2025–2026）", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 2, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T10:26:54", "source_id": "detail_9064386_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "兴起背景（2025–2026）", "text": "AI 颠覆轻资产：软件、互联网、内容等轻资产护城河被 AI 快速侵蚀，远期现金流不确定性上升。\n高利率环境：资金偏好现金流稳定、高壁垒、低波动的实体资产。\n供应链重构：地缘碎片化推动 “自主可控”，实体产能与基础设施价值重估。\n资本开支转向：AI 算力、新能源、数据中心带动实体资本开支超级周期。", "uid": "ee5e1a62d693", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9064386", "chunk_id": "bd2af97873c6", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "核心特征（筛选标准）", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 3, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T10:26:54", "source_id": "detail_9064386_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "核心特征（筛选标准）", "text": "高资本壁垒：单项目投资百亿级、建设周期 3–5 年以上，新进入者极难追赶。\n低技术淘汰：技术迭代无法替代，如电网、铁路、管道、通信塔、原材料产能。\n强网络效应 / 自然垄断：越用越值钱，边际成本极低，形成 “造不出来、拆不掉、替代不了” 的格局。\n现金流稳健：需求刚性、长协锁定、抗周期，分红与现金流确定性高。", "uid": "53bbf65abc7a", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
{"subject_id": "9064386", "chunk_id": "1d16644b447c", "area": "knowledge_area", "context_heading": "与传统价值股的区别", "date_hint": "", "global_order": 4, "source": "candidate_mixed", "created_at": "2026-04-01T10:26:54", "source_id": "detail_9064386_0", "order": 0, "used_fallback": true, "title": "与传统价值股的区别", "text": "传统价值：低估值、高股息，但可能面临需求萎缩或技术替代。\nHALO 资产：高壁垒 + 低淘汰 + 需求扩张，AI 与新能源反而提升其长期价值，是 “成长型价值”。", "uid": "f02adf06d6e8", "decision": "drop", "confidence": 0.5, "knowledge_value": "low", "reason": "fallback: missing from judge response", "knowledge_spans": [], "event_residue": "", "drop_target": "noise"}
